  "description": "The Haro Westlake is equally at home on smooth pavement or fire road trails, featuring Rider-Optimized geometry to make sure you always get the most comfortable ride. Some of the key spec's on the Westlake include a 6061 aluminum frame, Shimano 9-speed drivetrain, SR Suntour NEX HLO suspension fork, Tektro hydraulic disc brakes and a 700c wheel set with 38c width tires.\nHaro Solum Dual Sport frame with Rider Optimized Geometry, mechanically-shaped alloy tubing with chainstay disc brake mount\nSR Suntour NEX HLO suspension fork with 63mm travel and hydraulic lockout\nCold Forged Alloy crankset, 42T ring with dual alloy guards, sealed cartridge BB set\nShimano Altus M2000 9 speed rear derailleur\n9-spd Cassette 11-40T\nAlloy 25mm rise, 31.8mm OD x 9° backsweep handlebar\nAlloy disc brake hubs with 700c alloy double wall rims\nKenda Kwick Bitumen, 700c x 38c\nTektro HD-T275 hydraulic disc, 180mm F., 160mm R. rotors",
